--------------------------------------------------------------------------
POPTRANS.SLC    F1          Planet.key

    Transwarp planet populator.  Start with ship's holds empty and in the
    same sector as the planet to populate.  All information is asked for
    before the script begins (much nicer now, I think :).  It will get the
    current sector first, though.  Then enter all the requested information.
    You only have to specify the planet number to populate if you have a
    Planet Scanner or if there is more than one planet in the sector.  When
    the script checks the ships holds/type it will abort if all holds are
    not empty.  You can travel to Terra via a sector any distance outside
    Terra, or directly to sector 1 if you are good and have an alignment of
    1000 or higher.  Can handle Planetary Transporter now.

