TLXTWAST.SLC    Alt-T       Trader.key

    Twassist(c) Hooks.  Takes advantage of the Automode commands in
    Twassist 2.x.
    This script will change to the game's directory, exit Telix to free up
    all the memory, run Twassist, then reload Telix with the "O"nline
